***REMOVED******REMOVED*** What this does NOT change

- GitLab/BitBucket webhooks — they handle PR events, not task creation
- Worker epic code — reads `TICKET_SYSTEM` env var (unchanged, just gets better values now)
- Agent package — not involved
- Linear webhook description backfill at webhook time — stays (this is the RIGHT place)
